acheron is an alternative discord client written in c++ using
Qt6 Widgets that:

* Not Electron
* No, not Tauri either
* Feature tuning for low memory usage
* Cross-platform support (Win 7+, Linux, macOS)
* Voice support (E2EE & noise suppression)
* Multi-account support
* Browser impersonation to avoid spam filter
* Per-channel tabs
* Discord-compatible markdown parsing
* Embed support
* File upload support
* Unread and mention indicators
* Guild folders
* Edit, delete, pin, reply, react
* Emoji support
* Image viewer
* Typing indicators
* DMs and group DMs
* Threads
* Forums
* QR code login
* Animated emojis
